{"title":"King Statues","slug":"King_Statues","pageid":4165,"revid":19889,"timestamp":"2025-10-06T21:55:39Z","lastEditor":"MyPieIsE","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"king-statues","text":"King Statues"}],"body":"<p>(The current author cannot confirm the accuracy of the information on this page, please add if you have more informations)\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"king-statues\">King Statues</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: An image of the King Statue next to the Pyramid\">An image of the King Statue next to the Pyramid</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>An image of the King Statue next to the Pyramid</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The King statues are structures that can be found around the desert with different colored crowns and symbols. The use of the statues is yet unknown.\n</p><p>There exists a small map of the desert under the pyramid, accessible by the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave/\">Uncertainty Cave</a>. Another entrance to this cave can be found by the sea, west of the pyramid. On this map you can see the locations of the statues. \n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The small map representing the desert\">The small map representing the desert</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The small map representing the desert</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A King Statue with a fire symbol\">A King Statue with a fire symbol</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A King Statue with a fire symbol</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Most of the statues have symbols that most likely correspond to the swords from the ROBLOX game <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/47324/Sword-Fights-on-the-Heights-IV\">Sword Fight on the Heights IV</a>. The statues also hold swords that use the same mesh as the SFOTH swords. Due to the SFOTH link, the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Linked_Sword/\">Linked Sword</a> (the starter SFOTH sword) may be relevant to the statues.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>List of Statues\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Statue\n</th>\n<th>Corresponding Sword\n</th>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Black King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Darkheart\">Darkheart</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Darkheart King Statue\">Darkheart King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Darkheart King Statue\">Darkheart King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Black colour (<b>Dark</b>heart)\n<p>- Broken heart (Dark<b>heart</b>)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Firebrand\">Firebrand</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Firebrand King Statue\">Firebrand King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Firebrand King Statue\">Firebrand King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Fire (<b>Fire</b>brand)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Light Blue King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Windforce\">Windforce</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Windforce King Statue\">Windforce King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Windforce King Statue\">Windforce King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Wind (<b>Wind</b>force)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Venomshank\">Venomshank</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Venomshank King Statue\">Venomshank King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Venomshank King Statue\">Venomshank King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Poison/Venom (<b>Venom</b>shank)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>White King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Illumina\">Illumina</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Illumina King Statue\">Illumina King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Illumina King Statue\">Illumina King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Stars (Sparkle effect emitted by the Illumina in SFOTH)\n<p>- It's high-up location may reference the platform the Illumina is found on in SFOTH\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Icedagger\">Icedagger</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Icedagger King Statue\">Icedagger King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Icedagger King Statue\">Icedagger King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sword statue snowflake symbol\">Sword statue snowflake symbol</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sword statue snowflake symbol\">Sword statue snowflake symbol</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Snowflake symbol west of the statue. (<b>Ice</b>dagger)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grey King Statue\n</td>\n<td>Most likely <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Ghostwalker\">Ghostwalker</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Ghostwalker King Statue\">Ghostwalker King Statue</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Ghostwalker King Statue\">Ghostwalker King Statue</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- No symbol visible, has pale colouration of Ghostwalker (Lack of symbol could reference the invisibility ability of the <b>Ghost</b>walker)\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
